{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q2", "domain": "study", "question": "以下哪项描述符合命主的学历情况？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据八字命理分析，日主为己土，生于申月（金旺），年柱庚申、月柱甲申、时柱壬申，金水之气极重，日主己土偏弱。日支巳火为印星（火生土），是命局中唯一的生扶力量，且巳火为日主之根，说明命主有内在的学识根基和吸收能力。月干甲木为正官，与日主己土相合（甲己合），官星合身，代表有追求学历、社会地位的倾向。时柱壬水为正财，财星旺而透干，但财多身弱，需印星（火）来生身，而巳火印星得用，说明命主能通过学习和知识来平衡命局。\n\n从大运看，早年行癸未、壬午运，午火为印星旺地，利于学业；中年行辛巳、庚辰运，巳火印星持续助力，有继续深造的可能。综合判断，命主学历至少达到大学程度，且印星有力，有硕士的潜力，但财官过旺，可能因现实压力而止步于硕士前。最符合的选项是大学程度。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q2", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_2_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4807, "response_id": "a27eba94-bc46-4704-8766-8367ff3b2fbd", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 220, "completion_tokens": 267, "total_tokens": 487, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 92}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
